            "review_title": "Review at Atara Pub",
            "review_text": "Nam Dang\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nGreat place to drink beer\nDec 2022 • Solo\nVisited Atara last summer and the experience was excellence.\n\nThe restaurant was designed to be friendly place to drink beer with friends. Good music, delicious foods and nice view by the bank. Vibe is friendly and chill.\nStaffs can understand english, and the pub is fun till midnight with more foreign friends coming to party.\n\nPrice is really reasonable compared to other in the area.\nRead more\nWritten December 15, 2022",
